**Prime triples:** {2, 11, 29} and {2, 17, 23}.

## Finding All B-Triples (Constraint B)

I need all triples (x,y,z) with 1 ≤ x < y < z ≤ 35 satisfying xyz = 33(x+y+z).

Rearranging: z = 33(x+y)/(xy−33), requiring xy > 33. Systematically checking all (x,y) pairs:

